== demo: web :53046 -> api :53146 -> postgres :55466, spans and metrics to an in-process collector ==

## 1. The incident: members say the employer dashboard is slow
   concept: three processes (web BFF, API, Postgres) plus a collector; every process exports spans and metrics over OTLP/HTTP and writes JSON logs
   collector on :43793 (OTLP/HTTP JSON: POST /v1/traces, POST /v1/metrics; GET /api/traces/<id>, GET /api/red)
   130 requests through web :53046 -> api :53146 -> postgres :55466 in 16378 ms: 128 x 200, 2 x 502

