   api     GET /api/members/:id/statement           40     2.8       2  0-5 ms        5-10 ms       40 of 40 (100%)
   web     GET /employers/:code/dashboard           30     2.1       0  50-100 ms     1000-2000 ms  19 of 30 (63%)
   web     GET /members/:id                         60     4.2       0  0-5 ms        10-25 ms      60 of 60 (100%)
   web     GET /members/:id/statement               40     2.8       2  0-5 ms        5-10 ms       40 of 40 (100%)
