## 6. An error, traced the same way
   concept: RED counted 2 errors on the statement route; the error log line's trace id leads to the span that threw, with the exception recorded on it
   {"level":50,"time":"2026-10-04T06:15:37.224Z","service":"web","trace_id":"c31b830a666a3ef72a31e31e7a28246c","span_id":"98984f8fdeaeaf07","trace_flags":"01","method":"GET","route":"/members/:id/statement","path":"/members/1658/statement","status":502,"duration_ms":4,"msg":"request failed"}
   span api GET /api/members/:id/statement status ERROR, event exception: TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'period')
